                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "Hahaha, I created the first version of this in 2013 I believe, and have been getting back to it for a day or two every 4 years. It's ancient !\n\nBut what's super cool now is that I could upgrade to Vue 3 and typescript and add a bunch of features with Cursor within a day."
